  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The temperature of a fixed mass of an ideal gas is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> and the average speed of the gas molecules is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\"></span>. </p>\n<p>What is the average speed of the gas molecules when the temperature of the gas is increased to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3T\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{c}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{c}{\\sqrt{3}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3c\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\\sqrt{3}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
